### Normalized scores (1–100)

- **Tool use: 78/100.** Evidence Terminal-Bench Lite ~75%; capped by missing Claw-Eval/Tau3 isolation.
- **Reasoning: 78/100.** Evidence LiveBench Lite ~72%; capped by incomplete HLE/MRCR.
- **Context window: 96/100.** 1,048,576 (1M) — tiered per methodology (≥1M=95-100, 200K=70, 256K≈72).
- **Multimodal: 88/100.** Text, image, audio, PDF in; text out; scored per multimodal rubric (text-only 15, image 60-70, video/PDF 75-90, audio-in 90-100).
- **Coding: 78/100.** Evidence LiveCode 79-80% Lite; capped by missing isolated LiveCode/SciCode where noted.
- **Cost efficiency: 85/100.** $0.30/$2.50 per 1M (Lite).
- **Overall Score: 84/100.** Mean of five non-cost dims (78+78+96+88+78)/5=83.6 → 84; best-fit per scoring methodology.

